_nc_ohc=atJFLPkAfBIQ7kNvwEGprfG&_nc_oc=AdqXref7XMjd4r3KU1uyda47OLShiFjysQqavIoYJR6lEwBHoa33Z7uOO1rMXwxdBOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGsSf8hIhYZveup4spKpFCG9xdezJ0PQ_yUc-2nCOzv7g&oe=6A8D6AF7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yZ_tO1GzQlUQ7kNvwEFSFgK&_nc_oc=AdpD0WZ4gBMRkhAlXVYGDFOfprMXN2-PP-agQf514_F0n44Zr17YRU1dw_HOXQU5sEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF5udrh74Qq7CiV_s1SLTIPfRR1ap1RxpGrSRwfIJyFRg&oe=6A8D6C8A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fo92QvC0tS0Q7kNvwHtIMqn&_nc_oc=AdqqdUE6Rp5dXNp4iUUIDLIMhzNfsz19crb19oDBy5i0-zQK4vwk5YIpuphcTxhZ3TA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFLiSlsL6gbcqYD4513NpoYslwi3aQjm232HEltyaawOg&oe=6A8D91EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3HETtHuxphQQ7kNvwEOBFD-&_nc_oc=AdqGStLqbWm4v7TkcSVd1ZkfpO4Ixev1x2lpL6GaCE64PZOQmqMfH7eCMAPa7Jp2wPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGSXsJVC7d6IMflYzm5i6z6RhV_s-4byd4rT-kuvYabCA&oe=6A8D7B43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XakWKeiximAQ7kNvwFGzXA_&_nc_oc=AdpY7GJpXnInkx-l5NmB_Jya2yIgXWmjJsMTiLSeB52wEISZ458ZlCeRDgJLZvlNl2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGY3gfLH11yvVgbrV304fhXul1xJuhijt74dfh1Lwym7w&oe=6A8D7398"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IlS6um3PqREQ7kNvwF4O0P0&_nc_oc=AdrY8C1kM1CsL1vQwGyjlIM0t29lW5YY76ydoHpA2LcRaGEyRX9ARoUViV6wOj_uxyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFezyHRW0shcU4TNyjuUMds0mIiXFt6NIXgm9SlBAxiUw&oe=6A8D86BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_13386805878