s**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3HETtHuxphQQ7kNvwEOBFD-&_nc_oc=AdqGStLqbWm4v7TkcSVd1ZkfpO4Ixev1x2lpL6GaCE64PZOQmqMfH7eCMAPa7Jp2wPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGSXsJVC7d6IMflYzm5i6z6RhV_s-4byd4rT-kuvYabCA&oe=6A8D7B43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XakWKeiximAQ7kNvwFGzXA_&_nc_oc=AdpY7GJpXnInkx-l5NmB_Jya2yIgXWmjJsMTiLSeB52wEISZ458ZlCeRDgJLZvlNl2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGY3gfLH11yvVgbrV304fhXul1xJuhijt74dfh1Lwym7w&oe=6A8D7398"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IlS6um3PqREQ7kNvwF4O0P0&_nc_oc=AdrY8C1kM1CsL1vQwGyjlIM0t29lW5YY76ydoHpA2LcRaGEyRX9ARoUViV6wOj_uxyc&_n